<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<bpmn:definitions xmlns:bpmn="http://www.omg.org/spec/BPMN/20100524/MODEL" xmlns:bpmndi="http://www.omg.org/spec/BPMN/20100524/DI" xmlns:dc="http://www.omg.org/spec/DD/20100524/DC" xmlns:di="http://www.omg.org/spec/DD/20100524/DI" id="Defs_L3_3_5_4" targetNamespace="https://teck.example/process-models/pillar-03">
  <bpmn:collaboration id="Collab_L3_3_5_4">
    <bpmn:participant id="Pool_L3_3_5_4" name="3.5.4 Embankment Construction" processRef="Process_L3_3_5_4"/>
  </bpmn:collaboration>
  <bpmn:process id="Process_L3_3_5_4" isExecutable="false">
    <bpmn:documentation>L0/L3 Process. Builds and raises the embankment with the configured construction materials and method — classified sand placed in cells or paddocks, mine waste or rockfill, or borrow — to the construction plan, and surveys the facility geometry.</bpmn:documentation>
    <bpmn:laneSet id="LaneSet_L3_3_5_4">
      <bpmn:lane id="Lane_L3_3_5_4_con" name="Construction Supervisor / Surveyor">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>Start_L3_3_5_4_s</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>Task_L3_3_5_4_3_5_4_1</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>Task_L3_3_5_4_3_5_4_2</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>Gw_L3_3_5_4_g</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>End_L3_3_5_4_e</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>Task_L3_3_5_4_n</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>End_L3_3_5_4_e2</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>Start_L3_3_5_4_s2</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>Task_L3_3_5_4_3_5_4_3</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>End_L3_3_5_4_e3</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
      </bpmn:lane>
    </bpmn:laneSet>
    <bpmn:startEvent id="Start_L3_3_5_4_s" name="Construction material available">
      <bpmn:outgoing>Flow_L3_3_5_4_1</bpmn:outgoing>
    </bpmn:startEvent>
    <bpmn:task id="Task_L3_3_5_4_3_5_4_1" name="3.5.4.1 Place Construction Material">
      <bpmn:documentation>Material is placed in the active cell, paddock or zone of the embankment by the configured method: classified sand discharged hydraulically into cells, or mine waste, rockfill or borrow placed by equipment. Quantities are recorded by delivery (line flow for sand; truck counts or payloads for rock — a Pillar 2 interface where the material is mine waste). [P754: mass or volume (placed material) | line flow and density, truck counts, or survey | continuous / per load / periodic | Principles 1, 7 | NO — TP-04]
ISA-95 level: 0 / 3
Actors: Construction Supervisor / Surveyor; Tailings Operator
Standard alignment: ISA-95 Levels 0, 3; GISTM
DDVC layer: Curated (construction_placement_record)</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:incoming>Flow_L3_3_5_4_1</bpmn:incoming>
      <bpmn:outgoing>Flow_L3_3_5_4_2</bpmn:outgoing>
    </bpmn:task>
    <bpmn:task id="Task_L3_3_5_4_3_5_4_2" name="3.5.4.2 Drain and Compact Placed Material">
      <bpmn:documentation>Hydraulically placed sand drains in its cell until it can be spread and compacted; mechanically placed fill is compacted in lifts. Density and moisture tests confirm the specification. Drainage water reports to seepage and drainage collection (3.6.3).
ISA-95 level: 0 / 3
Actors: Construction Supervisor / Surveyor
Standard alignment: ISA-95 Levels 0, 3; GISTM
DDVC layer: Curated (construction_placement_record — compaction attribute)</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:incoming>Flow_L3_3_5_4_2</bpmn:incoming>
      <bpmn:outgoing>Flow_L3_3_5_4_3</bpmn:outgoing>
    </bpmn:task>
    <bpmn:exclusiveGateway id="Gw_L3_3_5_4_g" name="Placement meets specification?" default="Flow_L3_3_5_4_4">
      <bpmn:incoming>Flow_L3_3_5_4_3</bpmn:incoming>
      <bpmn:outgoing>Flow_L3_3_5_4_4</bpmn:outgoing>
      <bpmn:outgoing>Flow_L3_3_5_4_5</bpmn:outgoing>
    </bpmn:exclusiveGateway>
    <bpmn:endEvent id="End_L3_3_5_4_e" name="Material placed">
      <bpmn:incoming>Flow_L3_3_5_4_4</bpmn:incoming>
    </bpmn:endEvent>
    <bpmn:task id="Task_L3_3_5_4_n" name="Rework non-conforming fill">
      <bpmn:documentation>Derived from the Process Flow Narratives section (not a row in the Process Decomposition). Placement QA/QC response; no L4 row.</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:incoming>Flow_L3_3_5_4_5</bpmn:incoming>
      <bpmn:outgoing>Flow_L3_3_5_4_6</bpmn:outgoing>
    </bpmn:task>
    <bpmn:endEvent id="End_L3_3_5_4_e2" name="Rework recorded">
      <bpmn:incoming>Flow_L3_3_5_4_6</bpmn:incoming>
    </bpmn:endEvent>
    <bpmn:startEvent id="Start_L3_3_5_4_s2" name="Survey scheduled">
      <bpmn:outgoing>Flow_L3_3_5_4_7</bpmn:outgoing>
    </bpmn:startEvent>
    <bpmn:task id="Task_L3_3_5_4_3_5_4_3" name="3.5.4.3 Survey Facility Geometry">
      <bpmn:documentation>Periodic survey (drone photogrammetry, LiDAR or GPS) of the crest, embankment zones, beach and pond gives placed and deposited volumes, crest elevation and geometry change against the design. Survey volumes reconcile metered placement and deposition. [P754: volume (placed and deposited) | topographic survey | periodic | Principles 1, 3, 7 | NO — reconciles TP-04 and TP-05]
ISA-95 level: 3
Actors: Construction Supervisor / Surveyor
Standard alignment: ISA-95 Level 3; GISTM; AMIRA P754 Principles 1, 3, 7
DDVC layer: Raw; Curated (facility_survey_record)</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:incoming>Flow_L3_3_5_4_7</bpmn:incoming>
      <bpmn:outgoing>Flow_L3_3_5_4_8</bpmn:outgoing>
    </bpmn:task>
    <bpmn:endEvent id="End_L3_3_5_4_e3" name="Survey results to 3.5.5">
      <bpmn:incoming>Flow_L3_3_5_4_8</bpmn:incoming>
      <bpmn:messageEventDefinition id="Msg_L3_3_5_4_e3"/>
    </bpmn:endEvent>
    <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="Flow_L3_3_5_4_1" sourceRef="Start_L3_3_5_4_s" targetRef="Task_L3_3_5_4_3_5_4_1"/>
    <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="Flow_L3_3_5_4_2" sourceRef="Task_L3_3_5_4_3_5_4_1" targetRef="Task_L3_3_5_4_3_5_4_2"/>
    <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="Flow_L3_3_5_4_3" sourceRef="Task_L3_3_5_4_3_5_4_2" targetRef="Gw_L3_3_5_4_g"/>
    <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="Flow_L3_3_5_4_4" name="Yes" sourceRef="Gw_L3_3_5_4_g" targetRef="End_L3_3_5_4_e"/>
    <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="Flow_L3_3_5_4_5" name="No" sourceRef="Gw_L3_3_5_4_g" targetRef="Task_L3_3_5_4_n"/>
    <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="Flow_L3_3_5_4_6" sourceRef="Task_L3_3_5_4_n" targetRef="End_L3_3_5_4_e2"/>
    <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="Flow_L3_3_5_4_7" sourceRef="Start_L3_3_5_4_s2" targetRef="Task_L3_3_5_4_3_5_4_3"/>
    <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="Flow_L3_3_5_4_8" sourceRef="Task_L3_3_5_4_3_5_4_3" targetRef="End_L3_3_5_4_e3"/>
  </bpmn:process>
  <bpmndi:BPMNDiagram id="Diagram_L3_3_5_4">
    <bpmndi:BPMNPlane id="Plane_L3_3_5_4" bpmnElement="Collab_L3_3_5_4">
      <bpmndi:BPMNShape id="Pool_L3_3_5_4_di" bpmnElement="Pool_L3_3_5_4" isHorizontal="true"><dc:Bounds x="20" y="20" width="1024" height="510"/></bpmndi:BPMNShape>
      <bpmndi:BPMNShape id="Lane_L3_3_5_4_con_di" bpmnElement="Lane_L3_3_5_4_con" isHorizontal="true"><dc:Bounds x="60" y="20" width="984" height="510"/></bpmndi:BPMNShape>
      <bpmndi:BPMNShape id="Start_L3_3_5_4_s_di" bpmnElement="Start_L3_3_5_4_s"><dc:Bounds x="142" y="77" width="56" height="56"/><bpmndi:BPMNLabel><dc:Bounds x="110" y="139" width="120" height="42"/></bpmndi:BPMNLabel></bpmndi:BPMNShape>
      <bpmndi:BPMNShape id="Task_L3_3_5_4_3_5_4_1_di" bpmnElement="Task_L3_3_5_4_3_5_4_1"><dc:Bounds x="266" y="65" width="170" height="80"/></bpmndi:BPMNShape>
      <bpmndi:BPMNShape id="Task_L3_3_5_4_3_5_4_2_di" bpmnElement="Task_L3_3_5_4_3_5_4_2"><dc:Bounds x="472" y="65" width="170" height="80"/></bpmndi:BPMNShape>
      <bpmndi:BPMNShape id="Gw_L3_3_5_4_g_di" bpmnElement="Gw_L3_3_5_4_g" isMarkerVisible="true"><dc:Bounds x="728" y="70" width="70" height="70"/><bpmndi:BPMNLabel><dc:Bounds x="657" y="20" width="100" height="42"/></bpmndi:BPMNLabel></bpmndi:BPMNShape>
      <bpmndi:BPMNShape id="End_L3_3_5_4_e_di" bpmnElement="End_L3_3_5_4_e"><dc:Bounds x="916" y="77" width="56" height="56"/><bpmndi:BPMNLabel><dc:Bounds x="884" y="139" width="120" height="14"/></bpmndi:BPMNLabel></bpmndi:BPMNShape>
      <bpmndi:BPMNShape id="Task_L3_3_5_4_n_di" bpmnElement="Task_L3_3_5_4_n"><dc:Bounds x="678" y="235" width="170" height="80"/></bpmndi:BPMNShape>
      <bpmndi:BPMNShape id="End_L3_3_5_4_e2_di" bpmnElement="End_L3_3_5_4_e2"><dc:Bounds x="916" y="247" width="56" height="56"/><bpmndi:BPMNLabel><dc:Bounds x="884" y="309" width="120" height="14"/></bpmndi:BPMNLabel></bpmndi:BPMNShape>
      <bpmndi:BPMNShape id="Start_L3_3_5_4_s2_di" bpmnElement="Start_L3_3_5_4_s2"><dc:Bounds x="142" y="417" width="56" height="56"/><bpmndi:BPMNLabel><dc:Bounds x="110" y="479" width="120" height="14"/></bpmndi:BPMNLabel></bpmndi:BPMNShape>
      <bpmndi:BPMNShape id="Task_L3_3_5_4_3_5_4_3_di" bpmnElement="Task_L3_3_5_4_3_5_4_3"><dc:Bounds x="266" y="405" width="170" height="80"/></bpmndi:BPMNShape>
      <bpmndi:BPMNShape id="End_L3_3_5_4_e3_di" bpmnElement="End_L3_3_5_4_e3"><dc:Bounds x="529" y="417" width="56" height="56"/><bpmndi:BPMNLabel><dc:Bounds x="497" y="479" width="120" height="28"/></bpmndi:BPMNLabel></bpmndi:BPMNShape>
      <bpmndi:BPMNEdge id="Flow_L3_3_5_4_1_di" bpmnElement="Flow_L3_3_5_4_1"><di:waypoint x="198" y="105"/><di:waypoint x="266" y="105"/></bpmndi:BPMNEdge>
      <bpmndi:BPMNEdge id="Flow_L3_3_5_4_2_di" bpmnElement="Flow_L3_3_5_4_2"><di:waypoint x="436" y="105"/><di:waypoint x="472" y="105"/></bpmndi:BPMNEdge>
      <bpmndi:BPMNEdge id="Flow_L3_3_5_4_3_di" bpmnElement="Flow_L3_3_5_4_3"><di:waypoint x="642" y="105"/><di:waypoint x="728" y="105"/></bpmndi:BPMNEdge>
      <bpmndi:BPMNEdge id="Flow_L3_3_5_4_4_di" bpmnElement="Flow_L3_3_5_4_4"><di:waypoint x="798" y="105"/><di:waypoint x="916" y="105"/><bpmndi:BPMNLabel><dc:Bounds x="802" y="85" width="27" height="14"/></bpmndi:BPMNLabel></bpmndi:BPMNEdge>
      <bpmndi:BPMNEdge id="Flow_L3_3_5_4_5_di" bpmnElement="Flow_L3_3_5_4_5"><di:waypoint x="763" y="140"/><di:waypoint x="763" y="235"/><bpmndi:BPMNLabel><dc:Bounds x="769" y="144" width="21" height="14"/></bpmndi:BPMNLabel></bpmndi:BPMNEdge>
      <bpmndi:BPMNEdge id="Flow_L3_3_5_4_6_di" bpmnElement="Flow_L3_3_5_4_6"><di:waypoint x="848" y="275"/><di:waypoint x="916" y="275"/></bpmndi:BPMNEdge>
      <bpmndi:BPMNEdge id="Flow_L3_3_5_4_7_di" bpmnElement="Flow_L3_3_5_4_7"><di:waypoint x="198" y="445"/><di:waypoint x="266" y="445"/></bpmndi:BPMNEdge>
      <bpmndi:BPMNEdge id="Flow_L3_3_5_4_8_di" bpmnElement="Flow_L3_3_5_4_8"><di:waypoint x="436" y="445"/><di:waypoint x="529" y="445"/></bpmndi:BPMNEdge>
    </bpmndi:BPMNPlane>
  </bpmndi:BPMNDiagram>
</bpmn:definitions>
